size 100 10
start
keys <Tab> j <CR>
keys c c
type Sell
keys <End> <C-w>
keys <CR>
frame a-frame
file todo.txt a-file
-- config.toml --
show_detail = false
-- todo.txt --
Buy +home
Other +work
-- a-frame --
┌[3]─Projects─┐┌ [1]─+work ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ +home    1/1││  2       Sell                                                            filtered │
│>+work    0/0││                                                                                   │
├[4]─Contexts─┤│                                                                                   │
│             ││                                                                                   │
├[5]─Filters──┤│                                                                                   │
│ [x] Done    ││                                                                                   │
│ [ ] Later   ││                                                                                   │
└─────────────┘└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
 NORMAL  todo.txt  manual  2 Sell; hidden by current filters in 2 seconds or at the next key  x done
-- a-file --
Buy +home
Sell
